sses through the point where $(x,y,z)=(0,0,0).$" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398961 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398962 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398961 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398963 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398961 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398964 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398961 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398965 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398961 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398966 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398961 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398961 1077 "selection" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398961 1079 #edb/ref 17592186398962 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398961 1080 #uuid "91095769-6695-5735-bdf7-d8d4bfdca38b" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398962 1081 "2\\,i+2\\,j+2\\,k" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398962 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398962 1084 #uuid "4643060a-8d1d-5789-a362-102d70382db9" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398963 1081 "2\\,i+2\\,j+k" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398963 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398963 1084 #uuid "8070bb66-d16c-505c-85ee-2a417bc81d72" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398964 1081 "2\\,i+j+2\\,k" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398964 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398964 1084 #uuid "0bdcaf70-4358-5973-a594-026557c83288" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398965 1081 "i+2\\,j+2\\,k" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398965 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398965 1084 #uuid "61e68fe8-0332-53d0-b214-d38a39b52899" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398966 1081 "2\\,i+j+k" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398966 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398966 1084 #uuid "b9c9c882-083f-5978-8947-be71bba2f10e" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398967 1068 #edb/ref 17592186398968 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398967 1069 "q-72424" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398967 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398967 1071 "$\\int 16(7-2x)^{7}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398967 1072 #uuid "8c75bb9c-44e2-5f73-9a68-3c296ae237a7" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398967 1074 "Let $u=7-2x.$ Then differentiating with respect to $x$ gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=-2\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=-\\frac{1}{2}\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nWe now write our integral in terms of $u,$ calculate the integral as normal, and write the final answer in terms of $x$ at the very end:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int 16(7-2x)^{7}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int 16{u}^{7}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =16\\int {u}^{7}\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =16\\cdot (-\\frac{1}{2})\\int {u}^{7}\\,\\text{d}u \\\\  & =-8\\cdot \\frac{{u}^{8}}{8}+C \\\\  & =-{u}^{8}+C \\\\  & =-(7-2x)^{8}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLet's double-check that our result is correct. If we differentiate the result, then it should come out to the original integrand:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[-(7-2x)^{8}+C] & =-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}[(7-2x)^{8}]+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(C) \\\\  & =-8(7-2x)^{7}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(7-2x)+0 \\\\  & =-8(7-2x)^{7}\\cdot (-2) \\\\  & =16(7-2x)^{7}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398968 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398969 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398968 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398970 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398968 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398971 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398968 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398972 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398968 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398973 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398968 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398968 1077 "selection" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398968 1079 #edb/ref 17592186398969 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398968 1080 #uuid "6ee57767-a470-5ed2-888e-e7479cb9accb" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398969 1081 "-(7-2x)^{8}+C" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398969 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398969 1084 #uuid "6058cb14-4722-5ae2-982a-1d1d72759305" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398970 1081 "-\\frac{1}{2}(7-2x)^{8}+C" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398970 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398970 1084 #uuid "615ab3c3-1cc9-56db-a561-9ade7641ace4" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398971 1081 "(7-2x)^{8}+C" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398971 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398971 1084 #uuid "2b200597-1f86-5ecd-b8bc-18b09c132aad" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398972 1081 "\\frac{1}{8}(7-2x)^{8}+C" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398972 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398972 1084 #uuid "13a3fa38-b420-5956-8a4b-2194f2d8ef30" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398973 1081 "\\frac{1}{2}(7-2x)^{8}+C" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398973 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398973 1084 #uuid "5674f007-df38-5b04-ac90-1342c70182a8" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398974 1068 #edb/ref 17592186398975 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398974 1069 "q-73894" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398974 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398974 1071 "![](images/0e/0e0466f463644e25cd2a615c445b6b32a6d9ae236c44658609cd778c5222fcae.png)\n\nThe total area $A$ of the region between the curve $y={x}^{2}+3x$ and the $x$-axis from $x=-4$ to $x=-1$ is given by the integral expression below. What is the value of $a?$\n\n$$\nA={\\int }_{-4}^{a}({x}^{2}+3x)\\,\\text{d}x-{\\int }_{a}^{-1}({x}^{2}+3x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398974 1072 #uuid "6fa85593-213a-592b-beaa-a7478f15ea2f" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398974 1074 "To determine the missing limit of integration, we need to find the $x$-intercept of the curve $y={x}^{2}+3x.$ So, we set $y=0$ and solve for $x$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & ={x}^{2}+3x \\\\ 0 & ={x}^{2}+3x \\\\ x(x+3) & =0.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo we have $x=0$ or $x=-3.$ The only solution between $x=-4$ and $x=-1$ is $x=-3.$\n\nSince $-3\\in [-4,-1]$, we have two regions:\n\n- The area between the curve and the $x$-axis from $x=-4$ to $x=-3.$\n\n- The area between the curve and the $x$-axis from $x=-3$ to $x=-1.$\n\nSo, $a=-3$ and the final expression will be\n\n$$\nA={\\int }_{-4}^{-3}({x}^{2}+3x)\\,\\text{d}x-{\\int }_{-3}^{-1}({x}^{2}+3x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398975 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398976 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398975 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398977 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398975 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398978 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398975 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398979 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398975 1075 #edb/ref 17592186398980 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398975 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398975 1077 "selection" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398975 1079 #edb/ref 17592186398978 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398975 1080 #uuid "809e550a-3235-53e3-bcae-5eabda876862" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398976 1081 "-2.5" 13194139533476 17592186045585 true] [17592186398976 1083 #edb/ref 